@host = http://localhost:5276

### Search available rooms
GET {{host}}/api/rooms/search?checkIn=2026-09-16&checkOut=2026-09-19&guests=2
Accept: application/json

### Search - capacity filter (families)
GET {{host}}/api/rooms/search?checkIn=2026-09-16&checkOut=2026-09-19&guests=4
Accept: application/json

### Search - invalid range (expect 400)
GET {{host}}/api/rooms/search?checkIn=2026-09-19&checkOut=2026-09-16&guests=2
Accept: application/json

### Room details
GET {{host}}/api/rooms/1
Accept: application/json

### Room details - not found (expect 404)
GET {{host}}/api/rooms/9999
Accept: application/json

### Create a reservation (expect 201)
POST {{host}}/api/reservations
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "roomId": 4,
  "checkIn": "2026-10-06",
  "checkOut": "2026-10-09",
  "guestCount": 2,
  "guestName": "Jordan Blake",
  "guestEmail": "jordan.blake@example.com",
  "specialRequests": "Late check-in around 11pm"
}

### Create the same reservation again (expect 409 conflict)
POST {{host}}/api/reservations
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "roomId": 4,
  "checkIn": "2026-10-06",
  "checkOut": "2026-10-09",
  "guestCount": 2,
  "guestName": "Sam Lee",
  "guestEmail": "sam.lee@example.com"
}

### Retrieve a confirmation (replace with a real reference)
GET {{host}}/api/reservations/STAY-XXXXXXXX
Accept: application/json
